                                "sense_id": "d23539fd-1d2d-3c7c-9a5c-b8387702d64a",
                                "text": "It is probable they had stuck more to the lyery, black-beefed Dutch breed, than their more northern neighbours, at that unfortunate period when these were imported from the Continent […]"
