                                "sense_id": "d23539fd-1d2d-3c7c-9a5c-b8387702d64a",
                                "text": "In Lincolnshire, which is the furthest south that we meet with any number of this kind of cattle, they are, in general, more subject to lyery, or black flesh, than those bred further north; […]"
